  "description": "AWIVEJ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H60 Er4 N12 O20,2(C1 H4 O1),5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.777-3.903 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 107.00-115.25°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Er4(LH2)4(μ2-OH)4]·2CH3OH·5H2O (C64H60Er4N12O20·2CH4O·5H2O). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
